Fixtures from p4lang/tutorials (~/tutorials), 2026-09-17 and 2026-09-18.

COPIED VERBATIM (test_convert.FixtureProvenance compares every one of these to
~/tutorials/exercises/<same relative path> by sha256, and says so loudly when that tree is
not on the machine rather than passing silently):

  basic/pod-topo/{topology,s1-runtime,s2-runtime,s3-runtime,s4-runtime}.json
  basic/triangle-topo/{topology,s1-runtime,s2-runtime,s3-runtime}.json
