Copied rather than read out of ~/tutorials so the tests describe a fixed input: the tutorials
tree is a working copy somebody edits while doing an exercise, and a test whose subject can be
edited underneath it reports on whatever was last saved there. The `build/` directories are
here because a tutorials `sX-runtime.json` names its own p4info and bmv2 json, so a fixture
without them is a fixture whose entries cannot be checked against anything -- and, since G4,
because `switches[*].pipeline` names them too.

[Co-developed with claude code -- Adam]
